        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abagabisha b’ingabo bose, na Yohanani mwene Kareya, na Yezaniya mwene Hoshaya, n’abantu bose uhereye ku boroshe ugashitsa ku bahambaye, ",
          "type": "text",
