        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ko bizomerera abantu bose berekeza amaso kuja muri Egiputa ngo babeyo; bazokwicwa n’inkota n’inzara n’ikīza; ngo Kandi nta n’umwe muri bo azosigara canke ngo yikize ivyago azobatēza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukw ari k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ni we Mana y’Abisirayeli, ngo Nk’uk’ uburake bgiwe n’ubushangashirwe bgiwe vyasutswe ku baba i Yerusalemu, ni k’ubushangashirwe bgiwe buzosukwa kuri mwebge ni mwaja muri Egiputa; ngo Muzoba igitutsi n’ akajoreza n’ikivume n’iciro ry’ imigani: ngo Kandi ntimuzosubira kubona aha hantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho yavuze kuri mwebge, mwa masigarira y’i Buyuda, ngo Ntimukaje muri Egiputa: mumenye mudakekeranya yuko mbibashingiye intahe uyu musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erega mwāhenze imitima yanyu ubganyu, kuko mwantumye k’Uhoraho Imana yanyu, ngo Ni mbasengere k’Uhoraho Imana yanyu, ngw Ivyo Uhoraho Imana yanyu azovuga vyose ngo Ndabibabarire, ngo Namwe muzobikora: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "non’ uyu musi ndabibabariye, ariko mwebge ntimwumviye Uhoraho Imana yanyu mu kintu na kimwe mu vyo yabantumyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
